{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-opensheet-sidebar#card-zh","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-opensheet-sidebar","commit":"033a2f6c80fb05d209f8fb5b4189506bd423d39a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opensheet-sidebar 是面向 DSH Web 侧栏的表格预览插件，依赖 dsh-better-sidebar 提供的侧栏服务。它为 CSV、TSV、PSV 注册文件预览器，也为 XLSX、XLSM 注册工作簿预览器，并提供可拖放本地文件的独立标签页。表格支持搜索筛选和按列排序；解析器识别分隔符、处理带引号字段，并对行、列、单元格及工作簿解压设置上限，超出时显示截断或阻止提示。适合在 DSH 中快速查看结构化文本或电子表格。需要安装 dsh-better-sidebar，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:121-141","src/client/csv.ts:48-70","src/client/index.tsx:143-172","src/client/xlsx.ts:1-28","src/client/index.tsx:174-189","src/client/CsvLocalTab.tsx:18-34","src/client/CsvTable.tsx:19-46","src/client/circuit-breaker.ts:94-155"]}
